度指标。"},{"task_span_id":"span_a587f6","text":"将裁剪验证合格的视频流重新封装为通用留证格式，嵌入原始摄像头ID、截取时间轴及任务流水号等可追溯字段，生成标准化视频文件供后续归档与核查使用。"}],"scene_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_254999","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将截取视频监控中第15秒前后各5秒的视频片段用于留证。","params":{"时间范围":"第 15 秒前后各 5 秒","输出形式":"视频片段"}}],"sub_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_254999","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将截取视频监控中第15秒前后各5秒的视频片段用于留证。","params":{"时间范围":"第 15 秒前后各 5 秒","输出形式":"视频片段"}}],"task_hints":["提取必填参数：视频对象。需要分析的监控视频、摄像头、视频流、录像文件、实时画面、卡口视频或视频帧","提取可选参数：监控目标。需要识别或分析的对象、行为或事件，如人员聚集、车辆违停、越界、烟火、异常停留、摔倒、入侵、打架、遗留物、通行计数等","提取可选参数：时间范围。视频分析的起止时间、日期、时段、时刻或实时窗口","提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如告警、截图、时间点清单、检测结果、表格、报告、标注说明或风险摘要"],"mentioned_skill_ids":[],"confidence":0.9,"reason":"llm_scene_slot_rewrite","_source_message_key":"id:4dbbe458-6477-4570-8126-78faa38f3cf5"},"routing_context":{"route_mode":"scene_filter","trigger":true,"primary_goal":"<uploaded_files>\nThe following files were uploaded in this message:\n\n- Trafic-30s.mp4 (1.5 MB)\n  Path: /mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic-30s.mp4\n\nYou can read these files using the `read_file` tool with the paths shown above.\n</uploaded_files>\n\n以第 15 秒为事件时间，截取前后各 5 秒的视频片段用于留证。","scene_tasks":[{"scene_task_id":"task_001","segment_id":"seg_001","segment_text":"<uploaded_files>\nThe following files were uploaded in this message:\n\n- Trafic-30s.mp4 (1.5 MB)\n  Path: /mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic-30s.mp4\n\nYou can read these files using the `read_file` tool with the paths shown above.\n</uploaded_files>\n\n以第 15 秒为事件时间，截取前后各 5 秒的视频片段用于留证。","scene":"video_surveillance","input_refs":[],"task_types":[],"selected_skills":[{"id":"analyze-video","role":"primary","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"batch-video-ingestion","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"camera-health-check","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"city-video-intelligence","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"duplicate-event-merge","role":"suppor